      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T22:36:02.592040157Z",
      "description": "Writing: Writes quite smoothly for a nib this fine. Firm with no flex to speak of.\n\nFilling: Filling system works smoothly and easily. This pen has a breather tube which means the sac will hold more ink than your average lever-fill pen.\n\nCondition: Body is in good shape with age-appropriate light scratches. Metal trim is generally bright and clear; the cap ring shows some wear or plating loss. ",
