      "createdAt": "2026-08-16T19:14:51.490181814Z",
      "description": "Writing: Writes smoothly with some feedback and a bit of bounce.\n\nFilling: Lever system works well and the lever has good snap-back.\n\nCondition: The body color on this pen is beautiful and minimally yellowed. The cap has a circumferential crack in the darkest area; the inner cap is behind it and it does not seem to impact the pen structurally at all. The section has two dents in it where it looks like someone bit down hard with only their top teeth. The lever and cap rings are bright and clear; the ring shows a bit of corrosion-type wear.",
