      "createdAt": "2026-08-16T19:07:47.506005324Z",
      "description": "Writing: The nib has a nice amount of flex and handles that well, writing very reliably. I found that the feel of writing can vary quite a bit depending on the paper.\n\nFilling: Lever filling system works well.\n\nCondition: The gold-filled body has a Greek key pattern and is bright and shiny, with very little cosmetic damage. This pen is engraved with the initials J.A.B. -- It'd make a great gift for your favorite phlebotomist (or boxer)! Cap does not post.",
